<i>The AGE-1's data comes from the "War of B{r}at{man} Extermination,"</i>

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:21.470
<i>and the red one's combat data is from the last battle. {check for the operatio name}</i>

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:24.100
<i>The data processing took a little while.</i>

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:26.600
<i>That gave me time to talk to you, though.</i>

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:29.190
Where'd you get this data?

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:31.820
<i>I pulled it from the Gundam's computer.{And I thought they just said last episode that no one can access Gundam data, not even the EFF}</i>

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:34.780
Isn't that leaking military secrets?

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:37.160
Dique was happy to do it.

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:38.410
Mr. Dique...

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:41.330
<i>Hey, never mind that, the battle's starting!</i>

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:48.830
It has shock feedback features{dual shock? force feedback? rumble pack?}, too?{like a ps2 controller!}

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:51.210
Don't let your guard down just because it's a simulator!

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:52.000
<i>But...</i>

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:53.670
So you wanna stop?

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:57.010
<i>Give it a try, Asemu!</i>

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:59.090
<i>This is your chance to beat your dad!</i>

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:26.540
I can't fight these two at once!

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:28.330
No complaining.

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:29.920
Just do it, Asemu!

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:32.290
Sure, Flit's an amazing guy.

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:35.630
But you don't have to copy him.

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:38.800
You just do what you can.

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:40.470
What I can...

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:44.470
<i>You beat a Vagan mobile suit without any training, didn't you?</i>

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:51.980
<i>Move more freely.</i>

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:54.110
<i>Move however feels natural to you.</i>

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:55.900
Move more freely...

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:57.690
However feels natural.

00:19:26.180 --> 00:19:27.770
<i>That's right, Asemu.</i>

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:29.680
You're you!

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:31.980
Be strong in your own way.

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:36.940
The ones who are really strong, are strong in here!

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:38.110
Yes, sir!

00:19:46.280 --> 00:19:47.160
I hit him!

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:50.160
That kid's doing pretty well.

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:54.080
My my, you're a lot less harsh when it's not your own son.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:55.040
Shut up.

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:57.710
Do you think he can win, Mr. Woolf?

00:19:57.710 --> 00:19:59.880
Nope, not a chance.

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:02.220
I'll give him about three minutes.

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:21.190
Told you.

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:24.610
How'd it feel to fight your father?

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:27.740
<i>Let me do it again, please!</i>

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:28.870
Sure.

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:30.700
We'll carry on until you're satisfied.

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:36.840
<i>There are things only  </i>I<i> can do.</i>

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:38.710
<i>You're you!</i>

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:40.800
<i>Be strong in your own way.</i>

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:42.840
In my own way...

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:48.600
Strong in my own way...

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:55.350
Lord Ezelcant...

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:59.570
All preparations for the operation to capture Big Ring are approaching completion.{We will soon begin the first stage of Project Eden.}

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:04.240
<i>I'm sure you understand the significance of this operation.</i>

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:06.870
<i>It must succeed.</i>

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:07.660
Yes, sir.

00:21:08.030 --> 00:21:10.080
<i>Fulfill my expectations, Zeheart.</i>

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:11.580
Leave it to me.

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:15.750
For you, Lord Ezelcant, and for all the people of Vagan!

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:23.670
<i>Big Ring is the cornerstone of our Earth Federation Forces' space defenses.</i>

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:29.600
If it falls, the enemy will have a direct path to invade Earth.{oh no}

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:34.770
The Vagan are probably planning to attack us in huge numbers.

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:39.940
We will gather as much of our strength as possible to meet them.

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:43.110
This will be the fiercest battle yet.

00:21:43.990 --> 00:21:50.280
But I'm counting on your courage, and your pride as Earth Federation soldiers.

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:52.660
Godspeed{Good luck to you all}!

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:53.870
Yes, sir!

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:06.590
Commander, the preparations are ready.

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:07.340
Good.

00:22:07.930 --> 00:22:09.680
Begin the operation!

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:13.810
Our target is the EFF Command Center, Big Ring!

